WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.400
Hey! I'm Fumble, and I'll show you around. Follow me!

2
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.850
Everything starts up here. Tap Sync starters.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:14.650
Pick the league you want to sync. If it's private, I can't peek at it on my own, so we set up a bookmark.

4
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:22.200
See this box? Drag the green Sync button up to your bookmarks bar. It's a harmless little script that copies your roster.

5
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.300
Boom, saved! Now hit Go to league.

6
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:29.250
This is ESPN. Open any page inside your league.

7
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.200
Then click our Sync bookmark. Easy!

8
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:38.450
Back here, your roster data is waiting. Paste it in, and your starters are imported. Touchdown!
